      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/seakeenPH/status/2002164769323925763",
      "text": "🏃‍♂️🏀 𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐑𝐋𝐘𝐌𝐏𝐈𝐂𝐒 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟓 𝐗 𝐒𝐄𝐀𝐊𝐄𝐄𝐍 🔥\n♡ #sea_ta_lay | @sea_ta_lay\n♡ #keenkeno | @keenkeno\n\nIT’S FINALLY THE DAY!\n\nThe wait is over, the energy is rising, and Team Shadow Eagle is ready to take over STARLYMPICS 2025 with Sea & Keen leading the charge!\n\n⋇⋆✦⋆⋇　 🩵❤️　⋇⋆✦⋆⋇\n\n🗓 20 Dec 2025\n⏰ 03:00 PM | 15:00 (PH)\n📍 Impact Arena, Muang Thong Thani\n\n🗝 CHEER UP SEAKEEN NONGNOOONG\n#️⃣ #GMMTVStarlympics2025\n\n📉 Use the hashtag: All Day\n📈 Boost KW & hashtag starting at:\n⏰ 02:45 PM | 14:45 (PH)\n\n✅ Fans are welcome to participate in activities at the venue area\n❌ Please refrain from giving gifts and food of any kind\n\n⋇⋆✦⋆⋇　 🩵❤️　⋇⋆✦⋆⋇\n\n🏃‍♂️ 𝗣𝗹𝗮𝘆𝗲𝗿 𝟭𝟬𝟭 — Sea\nFlying down the track in the 4x100 Relay Race, ready to give it his all from start to finish.\n\n🏀 𝗣𝗹𝗮𝘆𝗲𝗿 𝟭𝟴 — Keen\nCharging onto the basketball court, bringing the fire, focus, and clutch energy we all know and love.\n\nWhether you’re in the arena or watching from home, let’s bring the loudest cheers, the biggest support, and all the Shadow Eagle energy.\n\nPLAYER 18. PLAYER 101.\nSEA & KEEN — LET’S GO! 🦅🔥",
